      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Video Storage and cost",
      "fontSize": 31.19999999999999,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Video Storage and cost",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Qsno-nFr4G2qmdiq1nqT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 312.1090105879936,
      "y": 189.5,
      "width": 234.90331963194407,
      "height": 200.78947368421075,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 956078518,
      "version": 710,
      "versionNonce": 1869298410,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785997535227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Cost Components\nStorage Cost (Fixed per month): When you upload 100 GB of raw videos, \nautomatically encodes them into multiple qualities (1080p, 720p, 360p) so students don't buffer. \nThis increases the total stored size to roughly 150 GB.\nCost: 150 GB \n×\n× $0.01/GB = $1.50 per month (assuming US/Europe storage).\nBandwidth Cost (Per Student): You are billed only when a student actually watches the videos.\nLet's assume a typical active student watches 25 GB of video in a month (roughly 25 to 30 hours of video).\nCost per student: 25 GB \n×\n× $0.01/GB (US/EU rate) = $0.25 per student per month.\nTotal Monthly Bill Scenarios\nHere is what your actual monthly Bunny.net bill will look like:\n\nScenario A: You have 1 Student\nStorage: $1.50\nBandwidth: 1 student \n×\n× $0.25 = $0.25\nTotal Usage: $1.75\nYour Bill: $1.75 (since it exceeds the $1.00 minimum).\nScenario B: You have 10 Students\nStorage: $1.50\nBandwidth: 10 students \n×\n× $0.25 = $2.50\nTotal Usage: $4.00\nYour Bill: $4.00\nScenario C: You have 50 Students\nStorage: $1.50\nBandwidth: 50 students \n×\n× $0.25 = $12.50\nTotal Usage: $14.00\nYour Bill: $14.00\nKey Takeaways\nNo upfront risks: If you launch your academy and have 0 sales in the first month,\n your bill will just be the $1.00 minimum (or $1.50 if your storage exceeds the minimum).\nExtremely cheap scaling: At 50 active students watching hours of content, you are paying only $14.00/month total. \nComparatively, hosting platforms like Vimeo Pro start at $20–$60/month regardless of whether you have 0 or 50 students.\n",
      "fontSize": 3.82456140350878,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Cost Components\nStorage Cost (Fixed per month): When you upload 100 GB of raw videos, \nautomatically encodes them into multiple qualities (1080p, 720p, 360p) so students don't buffer. \nThis increases the total stored size to roughly 150 GB.\nCost: 150 GB \n×\n× $0.01/GB = $1.50 per month (assuming US/Europe storage).\nBandwidth Cost (Per Student): You are billed only when a student actually watches the videos.\nLet's assume a typical active student watches 25 GB of video in a month (roughly 25 to 30 hours of video).\nCost per student: 25 GB \n×\n× $0.01/GB (US/EU rate) = $0.25 per student per month.\nTotal Monthly Bill Scenarios\nHere is what your actual monthly Bunny.net bill will look like:\n\nScenario A: You have 1 Student\nStorage: $1.50\nBandwidth: 1 student \n×\n× $0.25 = $0.25\nTotal Usage: $1.75\nYour Bill: $1.75 (since it exceeds the $1.00 minimum).\nScenario B: You have 10 Students\nStorage: $1.50\nBandwidth: 10 students \n×\n× $0.25 = $2.50\nTotal Usage: $4.00\nYour Bill: $4.00\nScenario C: You have 50 Students\nStorage: $1.50\nBandwidth: 50 students \n×\n× $0.25 = $12.50\nTotal Usage: $14.00\nYour Bill: $14.00\nKey Takeaways\nNo upfront risks: If you launch your academy and have 0 sales in the first month,\n your bill will just be the $1.00 minimum (or $1.50 if your storage exceeds the minimum).\nExtremely cheap scaling: At 50 active students watching hours of content, you are paying only $14.00/month total. \nComparatively, hosting platforms like Vimeo Pro start at $20–$60/month regardless of whether you have 0 or 50 students.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
